   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · WhatsApp adapter (Lesson 5.1)\nWhatsApp Cloud API test number -> filter -> normalise -> shared brain -> reply.\n\nCredentials:\n- WhatsApp OAuth (Meta app ID + app secret) on the WhatsApp Trigger.\n- WhatsApp API (access token + business account ID) on both WhatsApp send nodes. Use a permanent system user token, not the temporary dashboard token.\n- Telegram on Forward to Tolu.\n\nPlaceholders: YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID, YOUR_BRAIN_WORKFLOW_ID (the ID of SUB · Sage Desk brain).\n\nOne webhook per Meta app: test with a separate Meta app and number, never on the live webhook during business hours. Publish (activate) so Meta registers the production URL.",
